<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear,<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">Thank you for your interest in the <strong>Publicly Funded In-Vitro Fertilization Program</strong>. The Ministry of Health has reviewed your application (</span></span></span></span>{{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">) </span></span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">requesting an <strong>exception </strong>to the following program criteria</span></span></span>
<ul style="margin-bottom:11px">
	<li style="margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">The applicant undergoing the embryo transfer is 41 years of age or younger at the time of application</span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">The Ministry of Health has determined your application is not eligible, as the applicant undergoing the embryo transfer was over 41 years of age at the time of the application. [Exceptions to policy cannot be made due to delays related to surgical wait times or other waitlists (include if applicable)].</span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA">We understand this decision may be disappointing,&nbsp;</span></span><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">however, we hope this information helps clarify the decision for your application for the Publicly Funded IVF Program.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA">Sincerely,</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<strong><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-US">Publicly Funded IVF Program</span></span></span></strong><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:9.0pt">Beneficiary and Diagnostic Services Branch |LNBSD| Ministry of Health</span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:9.0pt">Address: 1515 Blanshard St, Victoria, BC V8W 1P3</span></span></span><br />
